<title>POLAND: GPRD JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 2.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>GPRD JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 2.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.00 vs   2.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.00 vs   3.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.02 vs   3.76</p>
<p> Sales		   17.23 vs  15.44</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.23 vs   1.94 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.23 vs   2.92 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.69 vs   3.02 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   50.25 vs  36.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish road builder is Gdanskie</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
